flowchart TD
    START[User launches Pipeline] --> LOAD[Load definition from PostgreSQL]
    LOAD --> BUILD[PipelineBuilder creates StepCommands]
    BUILD --> RUN[PipelineRunner executes in order]
    RUN --> STEP[StepExecutor.Run]
    STEP --> OK{Step succeeded?}
    OK -->|Yes| NEXT{More steps?}
    NEXT -->|Yes| STEP
    NEXT -->|No| DONE[Persist successful ExecutionRun]
    OK -->|No| ROLLBACK[ErrorHandler: Rollback completed commands LIFO]
    ROLLBACK --> FAIL[Persist failure and logs]
    STEP -. ProgressReporter events .-> UI[Windows Forms monitor]
